{"id":"3fd42600fc9ca7c0","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation.md","title":"Pi-Zero-One Separation Is Provable in RCA0","display":"thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation — Pi-Zero-One Separation Is Provable in RCA0","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation","aliases":["62-thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation"],"display":"thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation — Pi-Zero-One Separation Is Provable in RCA0","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-Pi01-separation]]","[[62-df-derivability]]","[[62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Exercise IV.4.8 (proof supplied)","source_pages":[144],"source_pdf_pages":[162]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-RCA0-Pi01-separation — Pi-Zero-One Separation Is Provable in RCA0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"943602149706a182\" href=\"?note=943602149706a182\" title=\"62-df-Pi01-separation\">62-df-Pi01-separation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a2192ee05ea4b819\" href=\"?note=a2192ee05ea4b819\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice\">62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Exercise IV.4.8 (proof supplied)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>162</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>RCA₀ 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"943602149706a182\" href=\"?note=943602149706a182\" title=\"62-df-Pi01-separation\">62-df-Pi01-separation</a>，可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>；数值见证搜索见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a2192ee05ea4b819\" href=\"?note=a2192ee05ea4b819\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice\">62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice</a>。 本断言中的理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}Pi01\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\quad\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}RCA0\\text{-}Pi01\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)\\quad\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_i(n)=\\forall s\\theta_i(n,s)\">\\(\\varphi_i(n)=\\forall s\\theta_i(n,s)\\)</span>，θᵢ 有界，两类不交。于是对每个 n，至少一边有失败见证。同步搜索最小失败对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,i)\">\\((s,i)\\)</span>；把先在 i=1 失败的 n 放入 X，其余不放入。φ₀ 为真时，i=0 永不失败而 i=1 必失败，故 n∈X；φ₁ 为真时恰相反。总有一个有限失败见证，使选择函数的图可用 Δ⁰₁ 理解形成，再取逆像。两边都假的情形由确定的数码搜索顺序任选一边。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Exercise IV.4.8 (proof supplied)；纸面页 144；PDF 页 162。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Pi01-separation","status":"resolved","id":"943602149706a182","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Pi01-separation]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice","status":"resolved","id":"a2192ee05ea4b819","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"RCA₀ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，$\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-Pi01-separation]]，可推导性见 [[62-df-derivability]]；数值见证搜索见 [[62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice]]。 本断言中的理论为 $\\mathrm{RCA}_0$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Pi01-separation","status":"resolved","id":"943602149706a182","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"RCA₀ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，$\\Pi^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-Pi01-separation]]，可推导性见 [[62-df-derivability]]；数值见证搜索见 [[62-thm-RCA0-Sigma1-choice]]。 本断言中的理论为 $\\mathrm{RCA}_0$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[